# Nail — English texts shared by several features (wave Q2, SSOT / ODR /
# DRY, ADR 0171): one id per meaning for generic labels that features
# repeated under their own ids ("Cancel", "Save", "Back", ...). A feature
# uses a `common-*` id when its text means exactly this; a text that reads
# the same but means something else keeps its own id (and an entry in
# scripts/duplicates/allow.json). Message ids `common-*`.
